$Name: 4. 义军崛起
$Type: single
+Description:
 XSTR("Generate your own unique campaign as a pilot for the Rebel Alliance.  Select choices such as time interval, overall goal, and starting rank.  Fleet and wingmen data is persistent across missions, allowing you to recruit large ships, gain squadron leadership, and improve your wingmen.  If you already completed a custom campaign, then you will be able to load persistent data from that previous play-through.

 Length: Variable
 Type: Dynamic (Rebel Alliance)
 Difficulty: Depends on Difficulty Settings", 2664)
$end_multi_text
$Flags: 0


